      "name": "Allia Health",
      "slug": "allia-health",
      "former_names": [],
      "small_logo_thumb_url": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/3d6f40f216c0da6b1f8b4caa594f59a5b194dd82.png",
      "website": "https://allia.health/",
      "all_locations": "New York City, NY, USA",
      "long_description": "Allia is the first AI-native clinical group for behavioral health. We bring hundreds of independent practices across all 50 states into one national group that can deliver, measure, and improve care at scale.\r\n\r\nNearly 1,000 therapy and psychiatry practices already run on our free platform, supporting >300,000 patients and nearly 1 million monthly visits. That's our wedge. We activate high-performing practices into our medical group, which now spans ~600 providers and ~70 sites, in-person in 32 states and telehealth in all 50 — with signed contracts with the country's largest health insurance payers.\r\n\r\nBehavioral health is the largest part of healthcare no one has organized: unmeasured, buried in admin, and fragmented across tiny practices. Being one clinically integrated group, powered by a single-instance OS (EHR, CRM, and RCM in one), is what makes care measurable, accountable, and coordinated — efficiently and at scale.",
      "one_liner": "Clinically Integrated Group for Mental Health ",
      "team_size": 3,
